Samantha Morton , long considered one of the U.K.'s finest actors working today and with a body of work going back more than three decades, is set to receive the British Film Institute's highest honor, the BFI Fellowship.

From her breakout role in Iris Kelly's 1997 feature "Under the Skin," Morton has displayed her talent for raw, empathetic performances in fellow indies such as"Morvern Callar," "Control" and "Synedoche, New York" to Hollywood blockbusters such as "Minority Report" and TV with "The Walking Dead," "I am Kirsty…" and "Band of Gold." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

In that time, she's received two Oscar nominations for best supporting actress, for Woody Allen's "Sweet and Lowdown" and Jim Sheridan's "In America." In 2024, which came shortly following her standout performance in "She Said," Morton was awarded the BAFTA Fellowship.

The BFI Fellowship lands just as Morton finds herself in awards season contention once more, this time for Christopher Nolan's epic "The Odyssey." Her portrayal of the witch Circe has earned some of the best reviews of her career, with many critics considering it to be the finest performance in the film.

&#x201C;A BFI Fellowship is the greatest honour and gift I could imagine. To be welcomed into such a distinguished community means the world to me," said Morton, who is set to receive the honor at the BFI Chair&#x2019;s Dinner on Jan. 28. "Both historically and moving into the future, to have female working class voices amongst past esteemed recipients means I can reach and hopefully teach and inspire a whole new generation who may be unfamiliar with the opportunities waiting for them. To find and nurture talent as yet undiscovered, wherever it may be found. How unbelievably exciting. I accept this honour and assume this role with the gravity it deserves." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

